# ALIS public mirror policy (denylist-first):
# - a tracked file is published unless it (or a parent dir) matches a rule below
# - folder name alone does not make content private: plugin Data/ JSON, schemas,
#   and Data-named source folders are published as reference; only forbidden file
#   TYPES (UE assets, binaries, media, key material) are stripped from them
# - code, docs, schemas, JSON data/config, and build/release scripts are public by default
# - secrets, licensed assets, generated outputs, and local machine state are never public
# - if a future workflow needs secrets, keep them outside the repository and outside the mirror

# Workspace and local machine state
.claude/**
.vs/**
.vscode/**
langchain_env/**
LocalAppData/**
tmp/**
tmpclaude-*
.env
.ignore
.clinerules
.vsconfig
agent_policy.yaml
AGENTS.md
CLAUDE.md
CODEX.md
*.code-workspace
*.code-workspace.backup

# Generated artifacts and local outputs
Binaries/**
Build/**
DerivedDataCache/**
Intermediate/**
Saved/**
Releases/**
artifacts/**
scripts/ue/check/reports/**

# Secrets, keys, and private infrastructure
# Never publish credential/key material or private infra config. Secret CONTENT
# is also caught by forbidden_text_patterns.regex and the validator as a backstop.
# Env files (fnmatch-safe: root, dotted, and *.env suffix forms all covered).
.env
.env.*
*.env
*.env.*
**/.env.*
# Key material.
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/id_rsa*
# Credential/secret material by NAME. Narrow on purpose (dirs + explicit
# suffixes) - a bare *secret* substring would hide legit gameplay/source files
# (e.g. SecretRoomDefinition.cpp). Secret CONTENT is caught by the validator.
secrets/**
**/secrets/**
.secret/**
**/.secret/**
**/*.secret
**/*_secret.*
credentials/**
**/credentials/**
**/*.credentials
**/*_credentials.*
# Private infra config.
**/wg*.conf
**/wireguard/**

# Game content and packaged assets
# Public mirror excludes UE asset payloads and packaged binaries.
# This keeps the mirror compatible with open-source code flow while avoiding redistribution of licensed content.
**/*.uasset
**/*.umap
**/*.ubulk
**/*.uexp
**/*.uptnl
**/*.ushaderbytecode
**/*.utoc
**/*.ucas
**/*.pak

# Binary media (raster images, video, audio, 3D, source art).
# Media is hosted on the site (fall.is) and referenced by absolute URL; the
# public mirror stays text-only. SVG is intentionally NOT excluded: it is text
# and useful for docs/diagrams.
**/*.png
**/*.jpg
**/*.jpeg
**/*.gif
**/*.webp
**/*.bmp
**/*.tga
**/*.tiff
**/*.ico
**/*.exr
**/*.psd
**/*.xcf
**/*.ai
**/*.fbx
**/*.3ds
**/*.glb
**/*.gltf
**/*.blend
**/*.wav
**/*.mp3
**/*.ogg
**/*.flac
**/*.mp4
**/*.mov
**/*.avi
**/*.webm

# Binary containers, databases, and model weights. The validator's binary-content
# guard is the real enforcement (fails any NUL-byte file regardless of extension);
# these explicit rules just avoid staging heavy containers. Ambiguous text-ish
# extensions (.bin/.dat/.db) are intentionally NOT listed here so a legitimately
# text data file is not excluded by extension alone - the content guard handles
# them if they are actually binary.
**/*.zip
**/*.7z
**/*.rar
**/*.tar
**/*.gz
**/*.tgz
**/*.xz
**/*.zst
**/*.onnx
**/*.pt
**/*.pth
**/*.safetensors
**/*.sqlite
**/*.sqlite3

Content/**
Config/**
Plugins/**/Binaries/**
Plugins/**/Content/**
Plugins/**/Intermediate/**
Plugins/**/Resources/**
# NOTE: plugin Data/ dirs are intentionally NOT excluded (denylist-first). They
# hold JSON schemas and live data-driven generator inputs (loot, dialogue, UI
# layouts, vitals) that are useful public references. Any UE assets inside Data/
# are still stripped by the **/*.uasset etc. rules above; the validator enforces
# that only text/JSON survives from these dirs.
Plugins/InstanceArrayTool/**
Plugins/Local/**
Plugins/ThirdParty/**
Plugins/**/ThirdParty/**
Test/**
tools/**
Wiki/**

# Internal docs and local automation
# These are excluded because they are repo-local workflow helpers or internal machine setup,
# not because ALIS documentation is private by default.
docs/agents/**
docs/ci/**
docs/debugging/**
docs/integration/**
docs/loading/**
scripts/config/**
scripts/ci/**
scripts/git/hooks/**
scripts/utils/**
scripts/scripts_list.txt

# Internal project files
Alis_sanitized.uproject
nul
